Subject: [M150] Fix slot assignment recalculation depth check and add
 defensive copies

Original change's description:
> Fix slot assignment recalculation depth check and add defensive copies
>
> Document::IsInSlotAssignmentRecalc() previously checked for exact
> equality with 1, returning false when slot assignment recalculation
> depth was 2 or greater. This could allow re-entrant recalculation to
> clear HTMLSlotElement::assigned_nodes_ during iteration.
>
> Update IsInSlotAssignmentRecalc() to check if depth is greater than 0,
> and add defensive copies of assigned_nodes_ before iterating in
> HTMLSlotElement to prevent use-after-free issues from synchronous
> recalculations.
>
> Fixed: 553121008
> Change-Id: I172d5f346e3905a18fd9648f5ea1aa97a5330325
